    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spearpoint Task Force",
    "summary": "Once per battle, the Assault Doctrine or the Tactical Doctrine may be chosen one extra time. ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED/SPEEDER units of yours get +1 to **[Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**. SUBODEN KHAN units of yours gain **Wrath of the First Khan**: as each **[Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase)** ends, if that unit had been eligible to fight in that phase, you may use the ability; an unengaged unit can then make a **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, and an engaged one may instead make a **[Fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**. Your army can contain WHITE SCARS units, but no ADEPTUS ASTARTES units belonging to another Chapter.",
